Usage: agent-deck connect test [--token-file F | --name N] [--url U] [--json]

Run list_sessions through the bridge with a token: over stdio (agent-deck connect serve)
or, with --url, over HTTP (POST <url>/mcp). Prints ok and the session count.
  -json
    	Output as JSON
  -name string
    	Test the token saved for this name (instead of --token-file)
  -token-file string
    	File holding the assistant token
  -url string
    	Test over HTTP against this agent-deck web URL (default: local stdio bridge)
